{"product_id":"little-book-of-bees-an-illustrated-guide-ot-the-extraordinary-lives-of-bees","title":"Little Book of Bees: An Illustrated Guide ot the Extraordinary Lives of Bees","description":"\u003cp\u003eA beautifully illustrated look at all things beeBees first appeared on Earth 130 million years ago. Since the time of the dinosaurs, evolution has taken our beloved bees on an incredible journey--today, there are 20,000 species on the planet. The Little Book of Bees is a lovely, informative book of all things bee--from evolution and communication to honey, bee-keeping, and saving the bees--all in a beautifully illustrated gift book. Bees continue to fascinate and charm us all--from novice gardeners and nature-lovers to dedicated environmentalists--and today, bees need our help more than ever. Discover the story of these incredible creatures with The Little Book of Bees.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 135 x 180\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Hilary Kearney\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781419738685\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 224\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45823797330073,"sku":"17RD-1-9781419738685","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68fb3a07b4462_Little_Book_of_Bees-_An_Illustrated_Guide_ot_the_Extraordinary_Lives_of_Bees_Hilary_Kearney.jpg?v=1761323028","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/little-book-of-bees-an-illustrated-guide-ot-the-extraordinary-lives-of-bees","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}